      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2011, the feature film Come Morning was shot in New Edinburg, and it remains the only production ever filmed there.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Edinburg%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Attwood, a town merchant, built the first brick store in New Edinburg, now home to McClellan's Country Store, the only mercantile establishment.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Edinburg%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Attwood built a Queen Anne Classic-style residence in New Edinburg, which Emmett Moseley altered in 1917 to its current appearance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Edinburg%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
